\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  In peace I do depart from here;
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 By the grace of God,
\par I am consoled, I keep quiet.
\par I reservedly
\par On my Lord's promises that
\par To me death will look like sleep.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. I know that Christ the Son of God,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 Our only Saviour,
\par He is the one who teaches us
\par As to believe that
\par God is the light of our lives
\par Both in our troubles and in death.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  He doth revealed it to mankind
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 And sows its glory.
\par He called to all human beings and
\par Made them His nation
\par His Word spread to far and near
\par These who heard it and believed.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. He is all the world's all in all,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 The genuine Saviour,
\par His light shines over all of them.
\par And He tends them too.
\par All Israel and all nations'
\par \pard    Thanksgiving and praise to Him.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

